#+TITLE:      Manifolding Mind Map
#+begin_comment
Web-based mind map / graph UI for manifolding-atlas notes.
Forked from org-roam-ui, ported to use manifolding-atlas DB.
#+end_comment

* SIMPLE-HTTPD — Tiny Web Server
:PROPERTIES:
:PACKAGE:  simple-httpd
:STRAIGHT: (simple-httpd :type git :host github :repo "skeeto/emacs-web-server")
:CATEGORY: notes
:END:

* WEBSOCKET — Websocket Client
:PROPERTIES:
:PACKAGE:  websocket
:STRAIGHT: (websocket :type git :host github :repo "ahyatt/emacs-websocket")
:CATEGORY: notes
:END:

* Manifolding Mind Map
:PROPERTIES:
:CATEGORY: notes
:END:

** Load Path
#+begin_src emacs-lisp
(add-to-list 'load-path
             (expand-file-name "lisp/manifolding-mind-map"
                               user-emacs-directory))
#+end_src

** Package
:PROPERTIES:
:PACKAGE:  manifolding-mind-map
:END:

#+begin_src emacs-lisp
(with-eval-after-load 'manifolding-atlas
  (require 'manifolding-mind-map)
  (setq manifolding-mind-map-follow           t
        manifolding-mind-map-update-on-save   t
        manifolding-mind-map-open-on-start    nil
        httpd-host                            "0.0.0.0"))
#+end_src


